"{\"reasoning\":\"INFEASIBLE: To meet GBW 20MHz with CL=2pF requires gm\u2248251\u00b5S, giving Itail\u224850\u00b5A and power\u2248331\u00b5W which fits power budget. Achieving DC gain \u226540dB demands long channel (L\u22481\u00b5m) for both NMOS and PMOS to get high gm/gds, but the dominant pole at the PMOS current\u2011mirror node is f_p\u2248gm3/(2\u03c0CL)\u224820MHz, equal to GBW, yielding phase margin \u224845\u00b0, below the 60\u00b0 requirement. Reducing gm3 to improve PM would increase Id (or require higher gm/Id), exceeding the 400\u00b5W power limit. Hence the specifications cannot be satisfied simultaneously with this 5\u2011transistor OTA topology in GF180MCU.\",\"gmid1\":10,\"L1_um\":1,\"gmid3\":10,\"L3_um\":1,\"gmid5\":10,\"L5_um\":1,\"Itail_uA\":50}"